{"id":"abfb943ceddb6090","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-weakly-compact.md","title":"Weakly Compact Cardinal","display":"df-weakly-compact — Weakly Compact Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weakly-compact","aliases":["58-df-weakly-compact"],"display":"df-weakly-compact — Weakly Compact Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weakly-compact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weakly-compact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weakly-compact — Weakly Compact Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (candidate uncountable cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeaklyCompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeaklyCompact}_S\\)</span> (weak-compactness predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 及序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\">\\([A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact}\\vdash\\mathrm{WeaklyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall c:[\\kappa]^2\\to2\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land\\forall a\\in[H]^2\\;(c(a)=i)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact}\\vdash\\mathrm{WeaklyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall c:[\\kappa]^2\\to2\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land\\forall a\\in[H]^2\\;(c(a)=i)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For uncountable cardinals, the expanded homogeneous-set property is the partition relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\to(\\kappa)^2_2\">\\(\\kappa\\to(\\kappa)^2_2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Every weakly compact cardinal is strongly inaccessible.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeaklyCompact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact}\\vdash\\mathrm{WeaklyCompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\forall c:[\\kappa]^2\\to2\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land\\forall a\\in[H]^2\\;(c(a)=i)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa\\to(\\kappa)^2_2","display":false}],"bytes":1176,"backlinks":[{"id":"4587738abfa987ee","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e935f19ab5bcebb3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1380","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-weakly-compact.md|58-df-weakly-compact]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}